# tests/llm-tools-only, as an ENTRY (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): evaluating
# this directory yields the test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# `--tools-only` is what `caos cc` runs: a step that executes the calls a
# request already declares and stops, leaving the request running for the next
# one. Nothing here scripts a model, and the stub's fixture directory is EMPTY
# on purpose -- a run that reaches the model finds no response and fails, which
# is the property being tested.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/worker-test --worker1:@=worker.sh --llm-step:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-step --stub:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-stub --tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test-tool --common:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test/worker-common.sh
